    .. math::

        \text{out}(N_i, C_j, l) = \frac{1}{k} \sum_{m=0}^{k-1}
                               \text{input}(N_i, C_j, \text{stride} \times l + m)

    If :attr:`padding` is non-zero, then the input is implicitly zero-padded on both sides
    for :attr:`padding` number of points.

    Note:
